{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"紧生成范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"紧生成范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>紧生成范畴通常是指 "},{"Local":{"url":"可表现范畴","text":"$\\aleph_0$-可表现范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>Ind-范畴</h3>\n<p>紧生成范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 是其紧对象的范畴的 "},{"Local":{"url":"ind-对象","text":"ind-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>代数理论的模型的范畴</h3>\n<p>设 $\\mathbb T$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"代数理论","text":"代数理论"}},{"Plain":"或"},{"Local":{"url":"本质代数理论","text":"本质代数理论"}},{"Plain":", 则其在 $\\mathsf{Set}$ (或 $\\mathsf{Ani}$) 中的模型的范畴是紧生成范畴.</p>\n"}]}}